<title>POLAND: Polish Elpo 1996 net rises to PLN 1.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Polish Elpo 1996 net rises to PLN 1.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elpo SA preliminary results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	  1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.88 vs    1.08</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   1.84 vs    0.77</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.32 vs    0.41</p>
<p>    net sales				 14.16 vs   12.89</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  10.34 vs   10.05</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.52 vs    0.35</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.54 vs    0.18</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.58 vs    0.49</p>
<p>    investment				 1.33 vs    0.73</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Zaklady Przemyslu Odziezowego Elpo SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
